Hi, Ian,

For your data, you can specify them as follows.

data {
   int<lower=0> Ndata;
   int<lower=0> Nsubj;
   int<lower=1, upper=Nsubj> subj[Ndata];
   int x[Ndata];  // real x[Ndata] is fine as well.
   real y[Ndata];
}

--
Jiqiang

