Subject: Can I optimize my complex, and slow to fit model?
Message-ID: <ezbkBUfpBuQ.D_LmrsvXyxsJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/ezbkBUfpBuQ/m/D_LmrsvXyxsJ>
